    "",
    "⚠ NOTHING HERE MAY BE PUBLISHED UNTIL A COMMITTEE MEMBER HAS CHECKED IT.",
    "Misspelling a real person's name on their own club's website is not an",
    "acceptable defect, and transcription is exactly where that happens.",
    "",
    "'file' is the source poster, so any entry can be checked against the",
    "original in seconds. Entries carrying '_check' are the ones I am least",
    "sure of — start there.",
    "",
    "── THINGS FOUND IN THE SOURCE, NOT INTRODUCED HERE ──",
    "1. Poster 11 reads 'MEDIA AND OUTREACE TEAM'. Every other poster for",
    "   that team spells it 'OUTREACH'. Recorded as authored, with the",
    "   correction in 'teamCorrected' — a human decides which is right.",
    "2. There is no 68.jpg. Posters run 1–83 with that one absent, plus two",
    "   files named after people. Either a poster was never made or one is",
    "   missing — worth asking whether an 85th member exists.",
    "3. The term years (e.g. 2024–25) appear NOWHERE on the posters. They are",
    "   left null rather than guessed (§8)."
